data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_part.done","sequence_number":100,"item_id":"rs_021d1f8d4b408b7b016acadec8947c8195904f21db9148b8c1","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"part":{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Implementing task history**\n\nI need to set up a history table to keep track of position tasks and ensure everything stays synced. I'll consider using an INSERT OR IGNORE to handle unique project-position pairs right from the start. I’m concerned about potential duplicates, especially since old positions might be involved. A unique position may not be necessary for each project-task pair, and I’ll check if functions like createTask and moveTask need to be adjusted as well. I'm working on finding the right transactional helper."}}

